  "draw": "census: all 95 witnesses of census.json, in order",
  "transcript": "The proposal artifact is canonically serialised as JSON with all object keys sorted recursively and no whitespace (no spaces, no newlines). A third party re-derives hProposal as the SHA-256 digest of the exact bytes of proposal_canon.json produced by that serialisation rule. The seed is then re-derived as SHA-256 of the concatenation of hProposal and the salt (both as hex strings, in that order). The engine-supplied values are: hProposal = b65b1d7467d62bbd0db323b02693d58b8cd376237b318f344eec1b77615b4f23, salt = e26c226dad6db0a8a41a5fce73a9014cd3550463729e090fcc9f9424ea60b477, seedHex = f55caaf2839fa72a20c1546804a3a26cbab631a03ebd53dfd3a55f1bd0d5a451. In CENSUS mode the draw rule selects every entry of census.json, all 95 witnesses, in their original order, without replacement or reordering. The proposer is not consulted in the derivation of the seed or the draw."
